@startuml TemplateMethod
' Patron Template Method. Vista enfocada — solo participantes.

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

interface Product {
    + getPrice(): Double
    + getDescription(): String
    + prepare(): void
}

abstract class ProductBase {
    + {final} prepare(): void
    # reserveStation(): void
    # {abstract} prepareIngredients(): void
    # {abstract} cook(): void
    # plate(): void
    # notifyReady(): void
}

Product <|.. ProductBase

note right of ProductBase
    Template Method:
    prepare() es final y fija el orden
    invariante de los pasos. Las subclases
    solo rellenan prepareIngredients()
    y cook() (los pasos variables).
end note

@enduml
